stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> queued
    queued --> running: runner picked<br/>the task up
    running --> completed: answer passed the<br/>non-answer guards
    running --> failed: error, budget exhausted<br/>or non-answer
    queued --> cancelled: operator cancelled
    running --> cancelled: operator cancelled
    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
